{
  "title": "The Past is the Future: Continued",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Past is the Future: Continued</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jinzhou\" title=\"Jinzhou\">Jinzhou</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Shixia invited you to join her in climbing the West Hill. Reach the hilltop before dawn.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Past_is_the_Future:_Introduction\" title=\"The Past is the Future: Introduction\">The Past is the Future: Introduction</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Past_is_the_Future:_Epilogue\" title=\"The Past is the Future: Epilogue\">The Past is the Future: Epilogue</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 500</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 40</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Energy_Core\" title=\"Advanced Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Advanced Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153038\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 18,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shixia\" title=\"Shixia\">Shixia</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Past is the Future: Continued</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Jinzhou\" title=\"Jinzhou\">Jinzhou</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Wait for Shixia's contact the next day</li>\n<li>Head to the foot of West Hill following the guidance</li>\n<li>Climb up the West Hill</li>\n<li>Open the object left by Shiyu</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This quest unlocks the next in-game day after finishing <a href=\"/wiki/The_Past_is_the_Future:_Introduction\" title=\"The Past is the Future: Introduction\">The Past is the Future: Introduction</a>, displaying \"Wait for Shixia's contact the next day\" before being unlocked.</li>\n<li>Completing the quest will award the player the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong_I\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Huanglong I\">Huanglong I</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/Future_is_Here\" title=\"Future is Here\">Future is Here</a></i>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Shixia invited you to join her in climbing the West Hill. Reach the hilltop before dawn.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Receive call from Shixia)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Hey, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), it's almost time. If you're ready, let's meet at the foot of West Mountain!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the foot of West Hill following the guidance)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> There you are! Looks like you're ready.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Many years ago, my sister climbed West Mountain on a rainy night and reached the summit at sunrise the next day.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> It's the same hour in the day now. This is when she started climbing. Let's go, we need to reach the summit before sunrise!</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> No time to chat; let's go!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Shixia, can you still keep up?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> No problem!</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> My sister used to climb really fast too. I always followed her pace, making my way up.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> In the end, I would always reach her side. This time won't be any different.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> The road ahead looks even more rugged, but I won't be stopped.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> This is a <a href=\"/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> generator that shoots Grapple forward when used.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I wonder if my sister left this for the convenience of later climbers...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> What kind of person is <a href=\"/wiki/Shiyu\" title=\"Shiyu\">Shiyu</a>?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> She's a bold and curious explorer, always uncovering fascinating finds. She shares her discoveries with the world through submissions to <i>Wuthering Geographic</i> magazine.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> While she's daring, she's also very considerate.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> If it weren't for her, I might not have as much experience, and I would be even more introverted than I am now.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> She brought about a lot of positive changes in me.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Looks like we've almost reached the top.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> There are a few more sections to fly through ahead.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> It's truly remarkable how my sister conquered this summit solo, facing numerous challenges along the way.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> The summit is right in front of us; we've made it!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Reach the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Look, we caught the sunrise! Fantastic!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> The sunrise after the rain is beautiful.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> If my sister hadn't joined me in climbing these summits, I might never have witnessed such breathtaking scenery.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I feel like I'm beginning to understand the emotions my sister experienced when she reached the summit and made decisions here.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> It's as if our hearts are inexplicably connected.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> As I gaze upon this scenery, I've arrived at a resolution for the new phase of my life.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> What is it?</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I'm one step closer to what I aspire to be.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I'll continue to grow and give my all at the <a href=\"/wiki/Ministry_of_Development\" title=\"Ministry of Development\">Ministry of Development</a> to make a meaningful impact. I'm not the same as my sister, but there's something only I can do!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Go for it! I know you can do it!</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Thank you so much! I wouldn't have fully understood my sister's intentions without your help.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Wait, look! Could that be something left by Shiyu?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Open the object left by Shiyu)</dt>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> This is... the token I made.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> We exchanged the tokens we made, motivating and supporting each other to pursue our life goals.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Why did she return my token to me...</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I understand what my sister wanted to tell me. I won't let her down.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> Player, thank you for accompanying me on this short treasure hunting trip, and sharing in the beauty of this sunrise.</dd>\n<dd><b>Shixia:</b> I won't forget about this journey.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-imag